bottomparticipants

actor Staff
boundary "Admin UI" as UI
boundary Router
control CommentController
control CommentService
entity ":CommentModel" as CommentModel
control AuditService
database MongoDB

Staff -> UI: 1. Click toggle visibility
activate Staff
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. PATCH /toggle/:id (JWT)
activate Router

Router -> CommentController: 3. toggleComment(id, req)
activate CommentController

CommentController -> CommentService: 4. toggleCommentVisibility(id, payload)
activate CommentService

CommentService -> CommentModel: 5. findById(id)
activate CommentModel
CommentModel -> MongoDB: 6. findById
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> CommentModel: 7. comment / null
deactivate MongoDB
CommentModel --> CommentService: 8. result
deactivate CommentModel

CommentService -> CommentService: 9. Check comment exists
activate CommentService
space
deactivate CommentService

opt Comment not found
    CommentService --> CommentController: 9.1 Throw BadRequestException
    CommentController --> Router: 9.2 HTTP 400
    Router --> UI: 9.3 Error response
    UI --> Staff: 9.4 Comment does not exist
end

CommentService -> CommentService: 10. Toggle is_delete flag
activate CommentService
space
deactivate CommentService

CommentService -> CommentModel: 11. save()
activate CommentModel
CommentModel -> MongoDB: 12. update comment
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> CommentModel: 13. saved
deactivate MongoDB
CommentModel --> CommentService: 14. done
deactivate CommentModel

CommentService -> AuditService: 15. createLog(auditData)
activate AuditService
AuditService -> MongoDB: 16. insert audit log
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> AuditService: 17. saved
deactivate MongoDB
AuditService --> CommentService: 18. done
deactivate AuditService

CommentService --> CommentController: 19. success result
deactivate CommentService
CommentController --> Router: 20. HTTP 200 + message
deactivate CommentController
Router --> UI: 21. Success response
deactivate Router
UI --> Staff: 22. Show result message
deactivate UI
deactivate Staff